removing it, and we test before disturbing it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does carpet installation take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A couple of bedrooms and a hall usually take one day, including removing the old carpet. A large basement or a full floor with stairs may take two."}}]}</script><!-- First-touch attribution. Runs before anything else so a click-id is never
